    {
      "id": 5,
      "translated": "Like, what do you call it?"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "translated": "Not exactly dust, but tiny particles floating around. The direction was so detailed."
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "translated": "I wondered how they did that. It was amazing."
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "translated": "The way everyone rotated and characters changed in the staging was so incredible, I was really surprised."
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "translated": "It was really good."
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "translated": "It really helped us look back."
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "translated": "It's so good... And the 2DMV is also amazing, please watch it."
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "translated": "The 2DMV, well, that's just what I thought,"
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "translated": "but they haven't explicitly said it, so I don't know about Mizuki's perspective. I haven't even asked, so I still don't know."
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "translated": "The whole 2DMV felt a bit like a birthday setting, like a birthday seat."
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "translated": "Mizuki was there, like at a cake, and it symbolically panned over things Mizuki had decorated."
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "translated": "Things like a letter from their older sister, or..."
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "translated": "ribbons, appeared, and it was really good, the 2D."
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "translated": "Both were amazing."
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "translated": "There was so much information, I was surprised."
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "translated": "And the song... I had the impression that Mizuki's song lyrics often contained sad words until now."
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "translated": "So, I'm not comparing it to past songs, but I really felt that this song has a lot of positive lyrics."
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "translated": "But even within that, there are emotions that Mizuki is grappling with,"
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "translated": "and I don't think they're someone who can fully express them. So, I consulted with the director about how much nuance to add,"
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "translated": "like, how much 'strength' to add or subtract, and we discussed various things to create this song."
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "translated": "Even the parts where it sounds like a radio, I was like,"
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "translated": "'Can I really put my emotions into it, maybe make my voice a little hoarse?' We discussed those kinds of nuances a lot for this song."
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "translated": "So please, enjoy both the full version 2DMV and the 3DMV where Mizuki smiles at you."
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "translated": "Both have already been uploaded to the official ProSeka YouTube channel,"
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "translated": "so I hope you'll check them out."
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "translated": "And with that, though it was a short time, this edition of ProSeka AfterTalk, \"Reaching for an Unraveling Tomorrow,\" has come to an end."
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "translated": "To everyone who watched the stream, how was it?"
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "translated": "Let's take a look at the comments."
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "translated": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "translated": "Oonuma Paseri's MV and N25's 2D have different vibes, but both are good."
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "translated": "That's right."
    },
    {
      "id": 36,
      "translated": "Mizuki, well, how should I put it?"
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "translated": "Like students deciding their future paths... ProSeka will soon celebrate its 5th anniversary."
    },
    {
      "id": 38,
      "translated": "Mizuki has been through a lot leading up to the 5th anniversary, and in that, they face forward."
    },
    {
      "id": 39,
      "translated": "To face forward, these things happened, but it's like, 'I'll do my best,' or..."
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "translated": "the feeling of 'I'll do my best' is expressed in that way."
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "translated": "I think it's decorated with N25's feelings, but Oonuma-san's version..."
    },
    {
      "id": 42,
      "translated": "How should I put it?"
    },
    {
      "id": 43,
      "translated": "is an MV where a tired working adult encourages themselves to keep trying and face forward."
    },
    {
      "id": 44,
      "translated": "I think that even with the same lyrics, depending on the singer, the performer, or the way it's expressed, the song itself has a really wide range."
    },
    {
      "id": 45,
      "translated": "That's what I thought. So please, Oonuma-san's version..."
    },
    {
      "id": 46,
      "translated": "Is it called 2D, that one?"
    },
    {
      "id": 47,
      "translated": "What do you call it?"
    },
    {
      "id": 48,
      "translated": "Is it an MV?"
    },
    {
      "id": 49,
      "translated": "I hope you'll enjoy that MV as well."
    },
    {
      "id": 50,
      "translated": "Again, to put it simply, up until now, N25's stories have often revealed heavy or suffocating aspects."
    },
    {
      "id": 51,
      "translated": "I think there were many stories that came to light, but this one, especially for high school second-years,"
    },
    {
      "id": 52,
      "translated": "and even third-years, I think it's an event story where high school students can truly empathize with the characters."
    },
    {
      "id": 53,
      "translated": "Things like how to decide your future path,"
    },
    {
      "id": 54,
      "translated": "or lacking confidence in accepting what you like, or not being able to love what you like,"
    },
    {
      "id": 55,
      "translated": "if there are people who feel that way right now—and that's not just students, but working adults too, of course—"
    },
    {
      "id": 56,
      "translated": "if you haven't seen the event story yet, or haven't experienced the song,"
    },
    {
      "id": 57,
      "translated": "I think this story and song might contain words that resonate with you precisely because of where you are right now."
    },
    {
      "id": 58,
      "translated": "So, I hope all you adults and students will enjoy it to the very end."
    },
    {
      "id": 59,
      "translated": "And so, for those who haven't finished the story for the event \"Reaching for an Unraveling Tomorrow,\" you can read the entire event story from the Event Stories menu once the next event starts."
    },
    {
      "id": 60,
      "translated": "Please read it."
    },
    {
      "id": 61,
      "translated": "It will probably be uploaded to YouTube later,"
    },
    {
      "id": 62,
      "translated": "so it's perfectly fine to wait for that."
    },
    {
      "id": 63,
      "translated": "We're always looking for messages for our AfterTalks."
    },
    {
      "id": 64,
      "translated": "We're accepting submissions for AfterTalk messages via the official ProSeka Discord channel's submission channel, or via email."
    },
    {
      "id": 65,
      "translated": "Please send one in when the next AfterTalk event starts."
    },
    {
      "id": 66,
      "translated": "Just make sure your messages are related to the event."
    },
    {
      "id": 67,
      "translated": "August is almost over, and then it'll be September."
    },
    {
      "id": 68,
      "translated": "After September, the fan festa awaits."
    },
    {
      "id": 69,
      "translated": "We're actually making preparations little by little, so please look forward to that too."
    },
    {
      "id": 70,
      "translated": "I'd be happy if you did. August is ending, but the heat isn't, so..."
    },
    {
      "id": 71,
      "translated": "everyone, please really be careful about heatstroke. If you think it's too much,"
    },
    {
      "id": 72,
      "translated": "I think it's perfectly fine to escape. Escape the heat."
    },
    {
      "id": 73,
      "translated": "Cooling down is the most important thing."
    },
    {
      "id": 74,
      "translated": "Everyone, let's somehow meet at the fan festa."
    },
    {
      "id": 75,
      "translated": "We'll be waiting for you at the venue too."
    },
    {
      "id": 76,
      "translated": "Thank you everyone for watching until the end."
    },
    {
      "id": 77,
      "translated": "Let's all survive the summer! And with that, I'll see you all again."
    },
    {
      "id": 78,
      "translated": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 79,
      "translated": "Bye!"
    }
  ]
